The previous Stage-23 phases progressively established the foundations required before designing an operational environment.

Phase-00 established the constitutional principles that govern every workstation decision.

Phase-01 established the institutional methodology through which engineering knowledge is acquired and validated.

Phase-02 established the professional operators whose workflows the workstation exists to support.

